package com.shahaabapps.core.content

/**
 * PSM I mock assessment: original questions written from The Scrum Guide
 * (November 2020), timed like the real sitting (80 questions in 60 minutes,
 * pass at 85 percent) with no feedback until the end. The pool is larger than
 * the draw so a retake is a different paper; it continues in Psm1Mock2 and
 * Psm1Mock3. None of these questions is taken from Scrum.org.
 */
internal object Psm1Mock {
